                <pb facs="0380" n="374" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg374"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-06-12"><hi rendition="#italic">June 12,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay approves suggestions in Mr. Rockhill’s telegrams of the 11th instant and
                    directs to do what he can for speedy conclusion; and, if practicable to obtain
                    them, to agree to 5 per cent effective with compensations mentioned.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
